React is a JavaScript library (by Meta) for building user interfaces from components. Each component is a function that returns what to show and updates when its state changes:
```jsx
import { useState } from "react";

export default function Counter() {
  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);
  return <button onClick={() => setCount(count + 1)}>Clicked {count} times</button>;
}
```
