The easiest way is flexbox (or grid) on the parent:
```css
.parent {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;   /* horizontal */
  align-items: center;       /* vertical */
  min-height: 100vh;
}
/* or: .parent { display: grid; place-items: center; } */
